<table class="memberdecls">
<tr class="heading"><td colspan="2"><h2 id="header-nested-classes" class="groupheader"><a id="nested-classes" name="nested-classes"></a>
Classes</h2></td></tr>
<tr class="memitem:ARAnchorDebugVisualizer" id="r_ARAnchorDebugVisualizer"><td class="memItemLeft" align="right" valign="top">class &#160;</td><td class="memItemRight" valign="bottom"><a class="el" href="class_unity_engine_1_1_x_r_1_1_a_r_foundation_1_1_samples_1_1_a_r_anchor_debug_visualizer.html">ARAnchorDebugVisualizer</a></td></tr>
<tr class="memdesc:"><td class="mdescLeft">&#160;</td><td class="mdescRight">Visualiza anclas AR en la escena para depuración y pruebas. Permite mostrar representaciones visuales de las anclas detectadas por AR Foundation.  <a href="class_unity_engine_1_1_x_r_1_1_a_r_foundation_1_1_samples_1_1_a_r_anchor_debug_visualizer.html#details">More...</a><br /></td></tr>
<tr class="memitem:ARPlaceAnchor" id="r_ARPlaceAnchor"><td class="memItemLeft" align="right" valign="top">class &#160;</td><td class="memItemRight" valign="bottom"><a class="el" href="class_unity_engine_1_1_x_r_1_1_a_r_foundation_1_1_samples_1_1_a_r_place_anchor.html">ARPlaceAnchor</a></td></tr>
<tr class="memdesc:"><td class="mdescLeft">&#160;</td><td class="mdescRight">Allows the user to place anchors in the AR space by tapping on the screen. It uses AR Foundation's raycasts to detect surfaces and position the anchors.  <a href="class_unity_engine_1_1_x_r_1_1_a_r_foundation_1_1_samples_1_1_a_r_place_anchor.html#details">More...</a><br /></td></tr>
<tr class="memitem:ARRaycastHitEventAsset" id="r_ARRaycastHitEventAsset"><td class="memItemLeft" align="right" valign="top">class &#160;</td><td class="memItemRight" valign="bottom"><a class="el" href="class_unity_engine_1_1_x_r_1_1_a_r_foundation_1_1_samples_1_1_a_r_raycast_hit_event_asset.html">ARRaycastHitEventAsset</a></td></tr>
<tr class="memdesc:"><td class="mdescLeft">&#160;</td><td class="mdescRight">ScriptableObject que representa un evento de ARRaycastHit. Permite crear eventos personalizados basados en ARRaycastHit.  <a href="class_unity_engine_1_1_x_r_1_1_a_r_foundation_1_1_samples_1_1_a_r_raycast_hit_event_asset.html#details">More...</a><br /></td></tr>
<tr class="memitem:EventAsset" id="r_EventAsset"><td class="memItemLeft" align="right" valign="top">class &#160;</td><td class="memItemRight" valign="bottom"><a class="el" href="class_unity_engine_1_1_x_r_1_1_a_r_foundation_1_1_samples_1_1_event_asset.html">EventAsset</a></td></tr>
<tr class="memdesc:"><td class="mdescLeft">&#160;</td><td class="mdescRight">ScriptableObject que implementa un patrón Observer simple. Permite que los oyentes se suscriban a eventos definidos en assets.  <a href="class_unity_engine_1_1_x_r_1_1_a_r_foundation_1_1_samples_1_1_event_asset.html#details">More...</a><br /></td></tr>
<tr class="memitem:EventAsset_3C_20T_20_3E" id="r_EventAsset_3C_20T_20_3E"><td class="memItemLeft" align="right" valign="top">class &#160;</td><td class="memItemRight" valign="bottom"><a class="el" href="class_unity_engine_1_1_x_r_1_1_a_r_foundation_1_1_samples_1_1_event_asset-1-g.html">EventAsset&lt; T &gt;</a></td></tr>
<tr class="memdesc:"><td class="mdescLeft">&#160;</td><td class="mdescRight">Serializable base class for an Observer pattern implementation that can be composed via the Inspector.  <a href="class_unity_engine_1_1_x_r_1_1_a_r_foundation_1_1_samples_1_1_event_asset-1-g.html#details">More...</a><br /></td></tr>
<tr class="memitem:RaycastEventController" id="r_RaycastEventController"><td class="memItemLeft" align="right" valign="top">class &#160;</td><td class="memItemRight" valign="bottom"><a class="el" href="class_unity_engine_1_1_x_r_1_1_a_r_foundation_1_1_samples_1_1_raycast_event_controller.html">RaycastEventController</a></td></tr>
<tr class="memdesc:"><td class="mdescLeft">&#160;</td><td class="mdescRight">Controlador que gestiona eventos de raycast en AR y dispara eventos personalizados. Permite conectar raycasts de AR Foundation con eventos definidos en assets.  <a href="class_unity_engine_1_1_x_r_1_1_a_r_foundation_1_1_samples_1_1_raycast_event_controller.html#details">More...</a><br /></td></tr>
</table>
